    "intro_narrative": "The surface world burned decades ago, leaving humanity to survive in subterranean bunkers. You are a scavenger who has stumbled upon Outpost Delta, a legendary military installation rumored to hold an untainted water purifier. The air is stale, and the emergency lights flicker ominously. Your Geiger counter clicks erratically, warning you that time is short. To secure the purifier and escape, you must navigate the outpost's ancient security systems, restore power to the forgotten consoles, and unlock the heavy blast doors before the radiation levels become lethal.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
